### Get suggestions

GET {{port6011}}/network/suggestions?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{raisa}}


### Send request

POST {{port6011}}/network/request HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{raisa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi, let's connect! I have dream to become a software engineer. I want to know many things from you.",
  "receiverId": "694a793d6f65b4f863400d6a"
}


### Get pending requests

GET {{port6011}}/network/request-pending?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{ashsrasu}}


### response/remove connection or cancel sent connection request

# / ACCEPTED | REJECTED | REMOVE // accpet/reject to response the request & remove to delete existing connection or cancel send request

PATCH {{port6011}}/network/response-or-remove HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{ashsrasu}}

{
  "requestId": "697887bbb92c730c8e2d95ca",
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}


### get connections

GET {{port6011}}/network/connections?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{raisa}}


### get my connections count

GET {{port6011}}/network/connections-count HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{raisa}}
